{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin a brand-new life in a world filled with quiet magic and possibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled between rolling fields and ancient forests, the valley of Mystood Haven has been left forgotten. Strange elemental magic now flows through the land and you\u2019ve been given the chance to restore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your home, help villagers rebuild theirs, grow your farm with elemental powers, and form meaningful relationships as the valley slowly comes back to life\u00a0 solo or in co-op with up to 4 players.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FARMING With ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm using elemental magic as part of everyday life. Water, Earth, Fire, and Air shape how crops grow, turning simple farming into a magical routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.poster.avif?t=1772146295\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.webm?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/509e5e69d66851ac799f40c7f74dbf75.mp4?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELEMENTAL SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the elements of Earth, Water, Spirit, and Air to interact with the world. Unlock hidden paths, treasures, and new possibilities through magic. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.poster.avif?t=1772146295\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.webm?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/162b26ba38d7624024a04746d4fb4081.mp4?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and expand your home and farm with cozy decorations and layouts. Create a space that grows alongside the land you restore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.poster.avif?t=1772146295\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.webm?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/6d923fb6b874614a246749697576eb4b.mp4?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIBRANT EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam across dynamic landscapes that shift with the day-night cycle. Witness a world that breathes, evolves, and welcomes the curious at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.poster.avif?t=1772146295\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.webm?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/f39cd025e75b66137fb874b20465219c.mp4?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVERSE MAGICAL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar, swim, climb, and blaze through diverse terrains using your elemental abilities, each providing a new perspective on the world's wonders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.poster.avif?t=1772146295\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.webm?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/a34fcf35cfb9af92d58ba94eac391d9f.mp4?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HORSE BONDING &amp; RIDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your horses and ride freely across rolling hills and hidden paths. Train them for friendly races. Unlock unique horse abilities and build your ranch with tiered companions, each with their own strengths, skills, and charm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/b89f4216fc360bc14d4b3d62b721eb8a.poster.avif?t=1772146295\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/b89f4216fc360bc14d4b3d62b721eb8a.webm?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/extras/b89f4216fc360bc14d4b3d62b721eb8a.mp4?t=1772146295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECIALTIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your playstyle through a flexible specialty system. Focus on farming, magic, exploration, or social life, and grow in ways that feel personal. </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with friends in a cooperative experience like no other. Farm, explore, and create shared narratives in a world where every action echoes with the magic of friendship. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELATIONSHIPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find love among 12 potential partners, each with their own magical narrative. Celebrate marriage with a partner who will join you in farming and life's adventures. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gender/sex, hairstyle, eyes, faces, skin tones, facial hairs, face painting, you can customize them all!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2783830?t=1772146295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2783830?t=1772146295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/fcf6487d90ed6a35617a526edbdf67a3a6368944/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772146295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783830/fcf6487d90ed6a35617a526edbdf67a3a6368944/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772146295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc